        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "-- Runs already handled, and runs the gate said \"not now\" to posting.\nSELECT coalesce((SELECT json_agg(run_id::text) FROM audit.w6_runs), '[]') AS handled,\n       coalesce((SELECT json_agg(target) FROM audit.deferred_requests\n                 WHERE action = 'questions-post' AND done_at IS NULL AND not_before > now()), '[]') AS waiting;",
